OL,3,GNEWSAPursuit 'abandoned' seconds before
OL,4,Acrash killed seven
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice abandoned the pursuit of a car
OL,7,Fseconds before it crashed going the
OL,8,Fwrong way down a dual carriageway,
OL,9,Fkilling all five men aboard and two
OL,10,Fofficers, investigators have said.
OL,12,FMichael Robert Cahill, 23, Jacob
OL,13,FMatusiak, 23, Theo Rae, 17, Makai
OL,14,FSaddington, 18, and Cole Robert Worthy,
OL,15,F17, died when a Volkswagen Passat
OL,16,Fstruck a Cleveland Police vehicle on
OL,17,FSaturday on the A66 near Middlesbrough.
OL,19,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,20,FClough, 38, who were on the correct
OL,21,Fside of the road and were helping
OL,22,Fsearch for the car, were also killed.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
